      "description": "Run editor transport steps from --script JSON: play, pause, seek(sec raw; "1:43"/e/s forms convert), wait(ms), sample(label), probe(ms). Reports playback/media state and frame timing. Seek replies carry all three bases. At most 50 steps and 60 s waiting. Repeat until ready. See agent-cli.md for click, wheel, and frame sampling.",
